      "content": "The image you are trying to protect is a fragile illusion, and trying to keep it up is what is hurting you the most right now. True connection with your parents, even if it's strained, is based on who you are, not on a flawless performance. Your value isn't tied to this single event, and while the immediate pain is immense, you are certainly not fundamentally ruined.",
